  "title": {
   "en": "Fushi-Ou wa Slow Life o Kibou Shimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "不死王はスローライフを希望します"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Immortal King Wants To Live A Slow Life"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After being reincarnated, the protagonist Sigmund awoke in another world as a meager ghost. Fleeing from monsters into a nearby cavern and slowly leveling inside of it, Sigmund had evolved into the all-powerful \"Immortal King\" before realizing it! Now, using the nearby vast forest as a base, gaining followers, constructing golems and working on building a self-sustained life is Sigmund's new goal. However, there's always trouble lurking around every corner...\n\n(Source: Alpha Manga)"
  },
